"18\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_user_check on_unfollow\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"on_follow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow neon</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following neon</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fi-am-neon.itch.io%2Finfinit&amp;intent=add_to_collection\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://i-am-neon.itch.io/infinit#comments\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://i-am-neon.itch.io/infinit/devlog\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4300036/infinit\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" target=\"_blank\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lora\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">Infinit</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_1267408\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_2731501\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div style=\"width: 640px; height: 360px\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" class=\"game_frame game_pending start_maximized\"><div class=\"restore_wrapper\"><button class=\"restore_btn button\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Restore game</button></div><div class=\"iframe_placeholder\" data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/16585479-1553688/index.html?v=1782613802&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>\r\n  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://discord.gg/sq6pQ6PfVV\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Join the Discord</a>\r\n  &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\r\n  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://tommy-wilczek.github.io/infinit-press-kit/\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Press Kit</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<h1>Infinit</h1>\r\n<p>\r\n  A visual novel RPG where you can do or say anything. An\r\n  <strong>AI Game Master</strong> &mdash; like a D&amp;D Dungeon Master &mdash;\r\n  reacts to your decisions on the fly. No dialogue trees. No predetermined\r\n  scripts. Type what you want to do, and the world responds.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n  The AI Game Master doesn&#x27;t just write narrative &mdash; it controls the game.\r\n  It changes the music, moves characters between locations, gives and takes\r\n  items, and triggers illustrated cutscenes. A separate AI agent maintains a\r\n  quest journal that tracks your discoveries. When you save, another writes a\r\n  summary of what you were doing so you can pick up where you left off.\r\n</p>\r\n<h2>Solhai</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n  The world of Solhai is not AI-generated. I wrote every character, location, and\r\n  mystery by hand, inspired by months traveling through Nepal and Bhutan.\r\n  <strong>The AI doesn&#x27;t create the world &mdash; it brings a hand-crafted world\r\n  to life.</strong> Everyone explores the same Solhai, but every playthrough is\r\n  different because the AI Game Master responds to <em>your</em> choices.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n  <em>Infinit</em> is built to be a platform. Right now there&#x27;s one world. In\r\n  the future, I want anyone to be able to create their own &mdash; writing\r\n  characters, locations, and lore that other players can explore through the\r\n  same AI Game Master.\r\n</p>\r\n<h2>Alpha</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n  I&#x27;m a solo developer and this is an early alpha. Things will break. The AI\r\n  will occasionally hallucinate. Some responses will be brilliant and some\r\n  won&#x27;t. I&#x27;m building this in the open because I think it&#x27;s worth playing even\r\n  in this state.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n  Every turn you take costs real money in AI inference, and I&#x27;m covering all of\r\n  it out of pocket. Play as much as you want while it&#x27;s up &mdash; I just can&#x27;t\r\n  promise how long that will be. I would love to hear your feedback &mdash;\r\n  comment here or\r\n  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://discord.gg/sq6pQ6PfVV\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">join the Discord</a>.\r\n</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" height=\"6\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1